WEBVTT

00:00:00.493 --> 00:00:01.198
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.573 --> 00:00:06.446
<v><b>A:</b></v> Excuse me, can I sit here?

00:00:06.694 --> 00:00:08.853
<v><b>B:</b></v> Er, yes, I think it’s free.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:09.933
<v><b>A:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:12.727 --> 00:00:13.302
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.522 --> 00:00:17.798
<v><b>A:</b></v> Can I help you?

00:00:18.389 --> 00:00:20.907
<v><b>B:</b></v> Do you have this T-shirt in large?

00:00:21.103 --> 00:00:22.234
<v><b>A:</b></v> Just a moment.

00:00:22.716 --> 00:00:27.346
Sorry, we only have small and medium at the moment.

00:00:27.672 --> 00:00:30.814
I can phone and see if they have a large in another store?

00:00:31.255 --> 00:00:33.373
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, that’s OK, thanks.

00:00:35.674 --> 00:00:36.413
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:38.802 --> 00:00:40.538
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you ready to order?

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:45.801
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, can I have the burger but with salad, not chips?

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:50.113
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, madam, that’s fine. And for you, sir?

00:00:50.251 --> 00:00:51.665
<v><b>B:</b></v> The pasta, please.

00:00:52.026 --> 00:00:53.146
<v><b>A:</b></v> And to drink?

00:00:56.545 --> 00:00:57.253
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:01:02.459 --> 00:01:03.815
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hey! You can’t sing here.

00:01:04.053 --> 00:01:06.393
<v><b>B:</b></v> Why not? A Because you need a permit.

00:01:06.643 --> 00:01:08.435
<v><b>B:</b></v> Where can I get a permit?

